{'symbol': 'FCX', 'date': '2023-02-12 22:42:00', 'title': 'FREEPORT-MCMORAN PROVIDES UPDATE ON PT FREEPORT INDONESIA OPERATIONS', 'text': "PHOENIX--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FREEPORT-MCMORAN INC. (NYSE: FCX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT PT FREEPORT INDONESIA'S (PT-FI) GRASBERG OPERATIONS HAVE BEEN TEMPORARILY DISRUPTED BECAUSE OF SIGNIFICANT RAINFALL AND LANDSLIDES IN THE AREA OF ITS MILLING OPERATIONS IN PAPUA, INDONESIA. INTENSE RAINS ON SATURDAY FEBRUARY 11, 2023, RESULTED IN FLOODING AND A FLOW OF DEBRIS, CAUSING DAMAGE TO INFRASTRUCTURE NEAR ITS MILLING COMPLEX. PERSONNEL WERE SAFELY EVACUATED FROM THE LOCALIZED AREA."}